# Used instead of the repo-root .dockerignore when building article_db/Dockerfile
# (BuildKit picks up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Allow-list: only the three packages the
# retrieval API imports go into the build context — no .env, data dirs or webapp.
*
!article_db/
!image_embedding/
!wikivoyage_stream/

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
